	addChatMessage("system", "AI copilot ready. Pick a provider + model via the Providers button (top-right of this panel). OpenAI, Google DeepMind and Anthropic are built in; add custom OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini-compatible servers with + Add Provider.")
end
